<view class="page"><view class="step"><text>01 选择时段</text><text>—</text><text class="active">02 核对确认</text><text>—</text><text>03 预约完成</text></view>
  <view class="title">{{context.oldAppointmentId ? '核对新的就诊安排' : '确认前，再核对一下'}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{context}}" class="hold-banner {{expired ? 'expired' : ''}}"><view><view class="small">{{expired ? '短时占位已到期' : '正在为你短时保留'}}</view><view class="countdown">{{remaining}}</view></view><view class="hold-note">{{expired ? '请返回重新查询时段' : '以服务器截止时间为准\n确认成功后才形成正式预约'}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!context && !pending}}" class="empty">没有待确认的时段，请先选择一个可预约时段。<button class="primary space" bindtap="chooseAgain">返回选择</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{context}}" class="card"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR APPOINTMENT</view><view class="section-title space">{{context.hold.slot.serviceName}}</view><view class="detail-label">就诊时间</view><view class="appointment-time">{{dateLabel}}—{{endLabel}}</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row"><text class="muted">门诊</text><text>{{context.hold.slot.clinicName}}</text></view><view class="row space"><text class="muted">医生</text><text>{{context.hold.slot.doctorName}}</text></view><view class="row space"><text class="muted">预计服务时长</text><text>{{context.hold.slot.durationMinutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="row space"><text class="muted">参考费用</text><text>¥{{priceLabel}}</text></view><view class="muted small space">医疗方案及实际费用以医务人员评估为准。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取本人资料…</view><view wx:if="{{patient}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">实际就诊人</view><text class="link small" bindtap="profile">修改资料 →</text></view><view class="patient-name">{{patient.name}}<text>账号本人</text></view><view class="muted">出生日期 {{patient.birthDate}}</view><view class="muted">联系电话 {{patient.phone}}</view><view class="allergy-status">{{allergyLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{patient.allergyStatus === 'known'}}" class="small">{{patient.allergies}}</view><view wx:if="{{patient.allergyStatus === 'unknown'}}" class="muted small">未知不代表无过敏，请到诊后与医务人员进一步核实。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{context}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">预约规则</view><view class="muted">自助取消或改期需提前 {{context.hold.policy.cancellationNoticeMinutes}} 分钟。临近就诊请联系门诊。取消与改期记录会保留。</view><view wx:if="{{context.oldAppointmentId}}" class="notice space">改期失败时原预约保持有效；成功后新旧预约保留关联。<text class="label">改期原因 *</text><textarea class="textarea" bindinput="reasonInput" value="{{reason}}" maxlength="500" placeholder="请简要说明改期原因" /></view><checkbox-group bindchange="checks"><label class="checkline"><checkbox value="patient" checked="{{patientConfirmed}}" color="#0b858d" /><text>我已核对实际就诊人为账号本人，联系电话正确。</text></label><label class="checkline"><checkbox value="rules" checked="{{rulesAccepted}}" color="#0b858d" /><text>我已阅读预约规则，了解短时占位与正式预约的区别。</text></label></checkbox-group></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="notice"><view class="section-title">提交结果待确认</view><view>已保留原操作标识和内容。网络恢复后请核对，重试将使用同一操作标识。</view><view class="buttons space"><button class="secondary" bindtap="inspect" disabled="{{busy}}">核对结果</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">重试原操作</button></view></view>
  <button wx:if="{{context && !pending}}" class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || expired || !patientConfirmed || !rulesAccepted}}">{{context.oldAppointmentId ? '确认改期' : '确认预约'}}</button><view class="footer-note">服务器提交成功后才会显示预约成功。</view>
</view>
